%% Policy-governed AI agents — editable verified-action sequence
%% This is a generic request lifecycle, not a private business workflow.
flowchart LR
    I[Interpret request] --> R[Resolve context]
    R --> C[Check eligibility and policy conditions]
    C -->|eligible| Q[Confirm when required]
    C -. rejected or ambiguous .-> X[Decline, clarify, or escalate]
    Q -->|confirmed or not required| E[Execute authorized operation]
    Q -. missing or declined .-> X
    E --> V[Verify structured outcome]
    V --> O[Communicate supported outcome]
    V -. failed or unverified .-> X

    classDef interpret fill:#2B211D,stroke:#D67B56,color:#ECE5D7
    classDef control fill:#182A31,stroke:#7FA7B4,color:#ECE5D7
    classDef action fill:#263A39,stroke:#7FA7B4,color:#ECE5D7
    classDef fallback fill:#272A2A,stroke:#B8A58C,color:#ECE5D7

    class I interpret
    class R,C,Q control
    class E,V,O action
    class X fallback
